TRV527-Z helps you manage your Radiator heating from your App. It can replace your existing thermostatic radiator valve (TRV) directly or with one of the 3 included adapters.

## Key Features

- Automatically turn on or off the radiator valve according to the schedule you set
- Set temperatures from the App or directly on the valve by touch-sensitive buttons
- ECO mode & Holiday Mode: maintain a lower temperature when you temporarily leave home
- Open Window Detection: automatically turn off heating when you open a window
- Child Lock, Anti-scale, Low battery alert
- ±0.5℃ accuracy, M30 x 1.5mm connection
- Works with OWON ZigBee Gateway and Home Assistant
